{"id":"n31693-1-7","stage":3,"title":"전용 · 专用","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31693-1-7-1","ko":"네 방이 생기니 좋니?","zh":"有自己房间了，开心吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방이","audio":"/audio/f8b8dcbdcf795ca5e772.mp3"}},{"text":"생기니","meaning":"有，拥有","explanation":"생기다：有，拥有；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"2","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생기니","audio":"/audio/263c040cc6584f9635b9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋니?","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋니","audio":"/audio/2c6dba2ccadd82ddb1e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，拥有","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"原本不是自己的东西成为自己的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/cedbdc1b9c13675f85e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31693-1-7-2","ko":"네, 저만의 전용 공간이 생긴 것 같아서 너무 좋아요!","zh":"嗯，因为有了属于自己的私人空间，我太开心了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"저만의","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；만：表示“只、仅”；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저만의","audio":"/audio/b636f6ebf2438a4f205b.mp3"}},{"text":"전용","meaning":"专用","explanation":"전용：专用。","readings":[{"term":"전용","audio":"/audio/87ac0b95ef60dd0d1c21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31693","senseId":"1","lemma":"전용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전용","audio":"/audio/87ac0b95ef60dd0d1c21.mp3"}},{"text":"공간이","meaning":"空间","explanation":"공간：空间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공간","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18694","senseId":"2","lemma":"공간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공간이","audio":"/audio/144c3c1d0320f4b68b47.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"有，拥有","explanation":"생기다：有，拥有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"2","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴","audio":"/audio/6a1f8f2f14401a79cbc7.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아서","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아서","audio":"/audio/a38b450f1fcf31c027d2.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요!","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"87ac0b95ef60dd0d","term":"전용","zh":"专用","audio":"/audio/87ac0b95ef60dd0d1c21.mp3","entryId":"31693","definition":"不和别人共同使用，只单独使用。","pronunciation":["저뇽"]},{"id":"a664be2148944933","term":"공간","zh":"空间","audio":"/audio/a664be21489449336498.mp3","entryId":"18694","definition":"宽广铺开着的空地。","pronunciation":["공간"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，拥有","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"原本不是自己的东西成为自己的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9803e12b14277d08c238.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.995,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31693","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有自己房间了，开心吗？","嗯，因为有了属于自己的私人空间，我太开心了！","喂，我们也别再输了，试着赢一次吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有自己房间了，开心吗？","嗯，因为有了属于自己的私人空间，我太开心了！","喂，我们也别再输了，试着赢一次吧。"],"answer":1}]}
